    "Every entry was kept on evidence — a manifest beside it, a declared cache. Sizes are what would actually be freed, clones deducted. Nothing is erased: everything goes to the Trash.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every entry was kept on evidence — a manifest beside it, a declared cache. Sizes are what would actually be freed, clones deducted. Nothing is erased: everything goes to the Trash."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque entrée a été retenue sur preuve — un manifeste à côté, un cache déclaré. Les tailles indiquées sont ce qui serait réellement libéré, clones déduits. Rien n'est effacé : tout part à la corbeille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
