    "Without it, Mail, Messages, Safari and the iOS backups read as empty, and the total is a floor. Grant it under System Settings › Privacy & Security › Full Disk Access, then measure again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Without it, Mail, Messages, Safari and the iOS backups read as empty, and the total is a floor. Grant it under System Settings › Privacy & Security › Full Disk Access, then measure again."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans lui, Mail, Messages, Safari et les sauvegardes iOS se lisent comme vides, et le total est un plancher. Accordez-le dans Réglages Système › Confidentialité et sécurité › Accès complet au disque, puis mesurez à nouveau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
